{"4537500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beat A Boo!", "steam_appid": 4537500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/044a94e9d03501721739968659adffb8.avif?t=1780506242\" alt=\"Beat A Boo!\" width=1560 height=303 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To serve Amdusias, the Great Duke of Hell , you are tasked with returning tortured souls trapped on Earth to their rightful place -to Him . But they don’t surrender easily. The ghosts of the damned conceal themselves behind cursed objects, and only by destroying these relics can you unveil their presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/1f9463081e4c6cf1867454e5be6edd51.poster.avif?t=1780506242\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/1f9463081e4c6cf1867454e5be6edd51.webm?t=1780506242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/1f9463081e4c6cf1867454e5be6edd51.mp4?t=1780506242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DO EVERYTHING YOU CAN TO SURVIVE. YOU ARE REPLACEABLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks everywhere in these haunted halls. Vicious monsters hide in the shadows, hungry for their prey. Countless traps lie waiting for their next victim. The more cursed objects you break, the more havoc you wreak. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make it out alive, buy weapons, use magical items, and boost your stats. Sacrifice everything to live. Even <span class=\"bb_strike\">Especially</span> your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/90cab83251ea1e1c78e30366de7e101b.poster.avif?t=1780506242\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/90cab83251ea1e1c78e30366de7e101b.webm?t=1780506242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/90cab83251ea1e1c78e30366de7e101b.mp4?t=1780506242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> AN EYE FOR AN EYE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> His wrath is a torment far worse than becoming monster food. Failure to seal the ghosts only seals your fate. A soul can only be replaced by another. If you want to keep yours, simply don't fail. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/95ec9f54644cd39b2a3cbb52467ed51b.poster.avif?t=1780506242\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/95ec9f54644cd39b2a3cbb52467ed51b.webm?t=1780506242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/95ec9f54644cd39b2a3cbb52467ed51b.mp4?t=1780506242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How hard can it be...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...Right?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> DEVIL'S ORCHESTRA.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to capture the ghosts is to perform a ritual—a concert from Hell. Every song must be performed to perfection. Only then can you drag the dead back to the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/bc83726825633672957939066606ad09.poster.avif?t=1780506242\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/bc83726825633672957939066606ad09.webm?t=1780506242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/bc83726825633672957939066606ad09.mp4?t=1780506242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just... Don't miss a beat, or you'll miss your heartbeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go up to that stage and break a leg out there! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/8f95a1185b0da2e196c5c5510d7a250d.poster.avif?t=1780506242\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/8f95a1185b0da2e196c5c5510d7a250d.webm?t=1780506242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/8f95a1185b0da2e196c5c5510d7a250d.mp4?t=1780506242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Let's go Beat A Boo!​     </strong></i></u><strong>( ⊙ ‿ ⊙ )</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/044a94e9d03501721739968659adffb8.avif?t=1780506242\" alt=\"Beat A Boo!\" width=1560 height=303 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To serve Amdusias, the Great Duke of Hell , you are tasked with returning tortured souls trapped on Earth to their rightful place -to Him . But they don’t surrender easily. The ghosts of the damned conceal themselves behind cursed objects, and only by destroying these relics can you unveil their presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/1f9463081e4c6cf1867454e5be6edd51.poster.avif?t=1780506242\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/1f9463081e4c6cf1867454e5be6edd51.webm?t=1780506242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/1f9463081e4c6cf1867454e5be6edd51.mp4?t=1780506242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DO EVERYTHING YOU CAN TO SURVIVE. YOU ARE REPLACEABLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks everywhere in these haunted halls. Vicious monsters hide in the shadows, hungry for their prey. Countless traps lie waiting for their next victim. The more cursed objects you break, the more havoc you wreak. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make it out alive, buy weapons, use magical items, and boost your stats. Sacrifice everything to live. Even <span class=\"bb_strike\">Especially</span> your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537500/extras/90cab83251ea1e1c78e30366de7e101b.post